WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.900
Gamma would never forget the horrific sight
of SCP-5967.

00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:11.059
On the surface, she kept her nerve; cool and
collected, her finger ready to squeeze the

00:00:11.059 --> 00:00:14.290
trigger as her weapon stayed trained on the
entity.

00:00:14.290 --> 00:00:17.550
But deep down, it turned her stomach.

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:21.980
After all, how is someone meant to react when
they see a thing like that?

00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:28.189
A mess of flesh and eyeballs towering above
them, staring back through more retinas than

00:00:28.189 --> 00:00:30.730
any living creature has.

00:00:30.730 --> 00:00:36.250
She didn’t yet know it, but she’d be seeing
that disgusting pillar of musculature and

00:00:36.250 --> 00:00:38.960
eyes in her nightmares for months to come.

00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:43.450
And still, it wasn’t even the worst part
of the incursion.

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:48.050
Far worse than seeing the five-meter tall
eyeball totem, watching it blink its many

00:00:48.050 --> 00:00:52.280
lids at her, was witnessing what it had done
to Alpha.

00:00:52.280 --> 00:00:57.239
Only moments before, Gamma’s commanding
officer had been in control of the situation,

00:00:57.239 --> 00:01:02.890
leading Mobile Task Force Lambda-5 into the
meadowlands of East Rutherford, New Jersey.

00:01:02.890 --> 00:01:07.440
The mission should have been a simple smash
and grab, the same old boring story their

00:01:07.440 --> 00:01:10.820
team had lived through countless times before.

00:01:10.820 --> 00:01:15.979
Pick up a high-value target, the leader of
yet another cult practicing an anomalous religion,

00:01:15.979 --> 00:01:17.760
and bring him in for questioning.

00:01:17.760 --> 00:01:21.680
Gamma never could’ve expected that things
would go this badly.

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:26.860
The task force had arrived to discover Caesar
Winters, the leader of a sect of Fifthists

00:01:26.860 --> 00:01:29.140
operating in New Jersey.

00:01:29.140 --> 00:01:33.970
When Lambda-5 discovered him, Winters and
his followers - locals who were all members

00:01:33.970 --> 00:01:38.619
of a group known as ‘the Commune’ - were
standing in a circle around an instance of

00:01:38.619 --> 00:01:41.710
SCP-5967.

00:01:41.710 --> 00:01:48.790
Standing at around five meters in height,
SCP-5967s were piles comprised of mostly musculature

00:01:48.790 --> 00:01:52.170
and organs that resembled eyeballs…

00:01:52.170 --> 00:01:53.930
human eyeballs.

00:01:53.930 --> 00:01:58.939
Despite lacking a mouth, vocal cords, or any
other conventional methods of speech, these

00:01:58.939 --> 00:02:02.380
pillars could still very much communicate
verbally.

00:02:02.380 --> 00:02:07.470
Although, they had little to say besides spouting
phrases and principles associated with the

00:02:07.470 --> 00:02:09.679
Fifthist ideology.

00:02:09.679 --> 00:02:12.920
Almost immediately, the plan to capture Winters
had gone awry.

00:02:12.920 --> 00:02:17.040
It was almost like he expected the Foundation
to arrive…

00:02:17.040 --> 00:02:19.080
like he knew they were coming.

00:02:19.080 --> 00:02:24.531
As the members of MTF Lambda-5 moved in, keeping
Winters in their sights, the anomalous cult

00:02:24.531 --> 00:02:29.980
leader somehow turned the gaze of SCP-5967
onto Alpha.

00:02:29.980 --> 00:02:34.379
The team’s field commander ordered Delta
to open fire, taking out Caesar Winters in

00:02:34.379 --> 00:02:37.700
a single shot… but only for a moment.

00:02:37.700 --> 00:02:40.900
Another of the Commune members keeled over
and began convulsing.

00:02:40.900 --> 00:02:46.260
A wound formed at the person’s neck, and
from it emerged Caesar Winters’ face.

00:02:46.260 --> 00:02:51.120
It grew into a full-sized head, replacing
that of the Commune member, giving Winters

00:02:51.120 --> 00:02:54.020
a brand new body in moments.

00:02:54.020 --> 00:02:58.410
On Alpha’s orders, to stop Winters from
hopping to more new bodies, Gamma and the

00:02:58.410 --> 00:03:01.680
others in their team fired on the other cultists.

00:03:01.680 --> 00:03:05.200
Everyone was terminated, fifteen seconds was
all it took.

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:11.680
Then they moved towards SCP-5967… and everything
went wrong.

00:03:11.680 --> 00:03:17.180
The bodies started to convulse violently,
as if some unseen hand was shaking them around

00:03:17.180 --> 00:03:18.629
like ragdolls.

00:03:18.629 --> 00:03:23.269
Gamma watched as they began to levitate, hoisted
by their necks and floating towards the Mobile

00:03:23.269 --> 00:03:24.620
Task Force.

00:03:24.620 --> 00:03:28.930
Not one of them knew what to do, keeping their
rifles up and trained on the corpses.

00:03:28.930 --> 00:03:35.280
Each one folded in on itself, becoming compressed
masses of muscle embedded with eyes.

00:03:35.280 --> 00:03:37.790
That was when the team lost Alpha.

00:03:37.790 --> 00:03:42.260
Something was happening to their leader, she
had dropped her weapon and fallen to her knees.

00:03:42.260 --> 00:03:46.769
Immediately, Gamma moved in to help her commander,
trying to pull her back to her feet.

00:03:46.769 --> 00:03:50.670
But Alpha was resisting, transfixed by SCP-5967.

00:03:50.670 --> 00:03:53.209
“It’s Her.

00:03:53.209 --> 00:03:59.470
She is lost deep in the cosmos and is angry
with us for not helping Her find Her way back.

00:03:59.470 --> 00:04:05.430
She will kill us all, lest we line our brains
and see Her for who She truly is!”

00:04:05.430 --> 00:04:10.090
Gamma watched as her team’s leader rushed
towards the pillar of eyes and licked it.

00:04:10.090 --> 00:04:15.409
The floating orbs of flesh and eyes that had
once been people suddenly hurtled towards

00:04:15.409 --> 00:04:18.989
the members of MTF Lambda-5 at high speed.

00:04:18.989 --> 00:04:24.380
Gamma dove clear at the vital moment, performing
a tactical roll and managing to narrowly avoid

00:04:24.380 --> 00:04:25.600
being struck.

00:04:25.600 --> 00:04:27.909
Beta wasn’t so lucky.

00:04:27.909 --> 00:04:32.580
Ready to retaliate, Gamma raises a weapon
to fire at the floating remains, only to hear

00:04:32.580 --> 00:04:34.509
Alpha ordering her to stop.

00:04:34.509 --> 00:04:40.639
She had stopped licking SCP-5967, but whatever
influence had compromised the Mobile Task

00:04:40.639 --> 00:04:43.789
Force leader hadn’t relinquished its hold
over her.

00:04:43.789 --> 00:04:47.700
She grinned unnervingly as her eyes rolled
back into her head.

00:04:47.700 --> 00:04:49.810
“Don't you hear Her voice?

00:04:49.810 --> 00:04:50.979
She is angry.

00:04:50.979 --> 00:04:52.569
But I can save you.

00:04:52.569 --> 00:04:53.700
I can save us.

00:04:53.700 --> 00:04:58.820
Let me show you,” Alpha said, before charging
at Gamma with her arms outstretched.

00:04:58.820 --> 00:05:03.350
In seconds, before she could defend against
her commanding officer, Gamma found herself

00:05:03.350 --> 00:05:05.210
pounced upon by Alpha.

00:05:05.210 --> 00:05:09.240
Grabbing a nearby rock, Alpha swung it at
her head and knocked Gamma’s tactical helmet

00:05:09.240 --> 00:05:10.300
clean off.

00:05:10.300 --> 00:05:15.830
Pinning her down, possessed by some unknown
anomalous entity, Alpha held open Gamma’s

00:05:15.830 --> 00:05:18.370
eyelids… and licked her eyeball.

00:05:18.370 --> 00:05:22.400
Gamma screamed in horror, as Alpha looked
up to the sky and yelled:

00:05:22.400 --> 00:05:24.039
“I can see you!

00:05:24.039 --> 00:05:26.240
I can see everything now!”

00:05:26.240 --> 00:05:32.600
The case of SCP-5967 is one of the stranger
tales within the annuls of the SCP Foundation’s

00:05:32.600 --> 00:05:33.600
history.

00:05:33.600 --> 00:05:37.389
Their investigation that led to the discovery
of these five-foot-tall pillars of eyes and

00:05:37.389 --> 00:05:41.069
muscle originally began with a different intention.

00:05:41.069 --> 00:05:46.050
The Commune had been making waves in Lyndhurst,
New Jersey, the kind of waves that had caught

00:05:46.050 --> 00:05:48.569
the SCP Foundation’s attention.

00:05:48.569 --> 00:05:53.860
The two leaders of this apparent cult were
Salem Steros and Caesar Winters, both of whom

00:05:53.860 --> 00:06:00.710
seemed to be able to use SCP-5967’s to take
control of the local residents’ minds.

00:06:00.710 --> 00:06:05.601
Anyone that they affected could be controlled
remotely by either Steros or Winters, with

00:06:05.601 --> 00:06:11.979
a seemingly unlimited range and no known way
of relinquishing their control over an affected

00:06:11.979 --> 00:06:12.979
person.

00:06:12.979 --> 00:06:17.850
Amnestic treatments, hypnotherapy, none of
the Foundation’s usual methods worked.

00:06:17.850 --> 00:06:22.180
Undercover Foundation operatives working secretly
within the Lyndhurst Police Department were

00:06:22.180 --> 00:06:28.400
the first to discover an instance of SCP-5967,
right under their noses.

00:06:28.400 --> 00:06:32.539
Literally, the pillar of eyeballs seemed to
have sprouted up right in the middle of the

00:06:32.539 --> 00:06:34.599
Lyndhurst Police Station.

00:06:34.599 --> 00:06:39.699
The Foundation sent in containment teams to
secure the area and administer amnestics to

00:06:39.699 --> 00:06:40.699
witnesses.

00:06:40.699 --> 00:06:45.860
But just how were Steros and Winters causing
these monstrous musculature monoliths to appear?

00:06:45.860 --> 00:06:51.360
Well, the pair operated a radio show together,
known as The Reality Cinq.

00:06:51.360 --> 00:06:55.960
However, the Foundation agents within Lyndhurst
had been unable to track down exactly where

00:06:55.960 --> 00:06:57.830
they were broadcasting from.

00:06:57.830 --> 00:07:03.979
However, after the SCP-5967 instance appeared
within the police station, the answer seemed

00:07:03.979 --> 00:07:05.639
to present itself.

00:07:05.639 --> 00:07:10.140
During the building’s reconstruction, tapes
of their radio show were recovered, seeming

00:07:10.140 --> 00:07:15.300
to suggest that the pair had been utilizing
anomalous means to broadcast The Reality Cinq

00:07:15.300 --> 00:07:20.120
from within the station itself, while keeping
themselves concealed.

00:07:20.120 --> 00:07:24.900
The Reality Cinq was a religious talk show,
specifically focused on discussing elements

00:07:24.900 --> 00:07:30.010
of Fifthism with the audience and callers
who phoned into Winters and Steros’ hidden

00:07:30.010 --> 00:07:31.010
studio.

00:07:31.010 --> 00:07:32.350
What exactly is Fifthism?

00:07:32.350 --> 00:07:36.370
Well, there’s no easy answer to that question
unfortunately.

00:07:36.370 --> 00:07:41.210
Other anomalous cults and religions at least
have a core tenet or belief at their center.

00:07:41.210 --> 00:07:46.150
Sarkicism is the worship of disease and decay,
while Mekhanites from the Church of the Broken

00:07:46.150 --> 00:07:48.120
God venerate technology.

00:07:48.120 --> 00:07:52.370
The beliefs of the Fifth Church are a little
more interchangeable, however.

00:07:52.370 --> 00:07:56.300
They don't really have any defined theology
or religious practices.

00:07:56.300 --> 00:08:01.360
Fifthism is often more just a collection of
recurring ideas and motifs; the number five,

00:08:01.360 --> 00:08:06.539
stars, and the belief in an external cosmic
god, often a malicious one.

00:08:06.539 --> 00:08:11.479
In fact, if there is a defining principle
of Fifthism, it’s that it is an anomalous

00:08:11.479 --> 00:08:15.509
way of thinking that can’t really be understood.

00:08:15.509 --> 00:08:20.229
Practitioners of Fifthism are concerned primarily
with transcending reality, as we perceive

00:08:20.229 --> 00:08:21.229
it.

00:08:21.229 --> 00:08:26.199
They are highly interested in entities and
anomalies that can warp and shape reality,

00:08:26.199 --> 00:08:29.039
to the extent of even being fearful of such
beings.

00:08:29.039 --> 00:08:33.280
A lot of Fifthists seek to not only spread
their influence to others through any means

00:08:33.280 --> 00:08:39.010
necessary - including brainwashing - but also
hope to transcend humanity to a higher plane

00:08:39.010 --> 00:08:41.460
reality: the Fifth Dimension.

00:08:41.460 --> 00:08:46.570
There, in theory, a person would cease to
be a human being, and wouldn’t even really

00:08:46.570 --> 00:08:50.100
be akin to a god or powerful reality bender.

00:08:50.100 --> 00:08:56.190
Instead, they would become something more
vague, a concept, unable to be fully defined

00:08:56.190 --> 00:08:59.510
or to exist in reality completely.

00:08:59.510 --> 00:09:04.580
Fifthists follow this goal, presumably with
the intention of saving humankind from reality-warping

00:09:04.580 --> 00:09:05.580
anomalies.

00:09:05.580 --> 00:09:09.630
And they’ll use any infectious brainwashing
methods at their disposal to bring as many

00:09:09.630 --> 00:09:12.930
people as they can into their way of thinking.

00:09:12.930 --> 00:09:18.640
This brings us neatly back to Caesar Winters
and Salem Steros’ radio show, the Reality

00:09:18.640 --> 00:09:19.710
Cinq.

00:09:19.710 --> 00:09:24.450
This was the Commune’s - their particular
sect of Fifthism - way of spreading what they

00:09:24.450 --> 00:09:26.860
referred to as the truth.

00:09:26.860 --> 00:09:31.250
Based on the various fragmented cassette recordings
of their show that the SCP Foundation were

00:09:31.250 --> 00:09:37.240
able to recover, both Steros and Winters believed
in a many-armed goddess, referred to only

00:09:37.240 --> 00:09:39.459
as She or Her.

00:09:39.459 --> 00:09:43.510
They encouraged their listeners to pray to
this entity and let Her know that they were

00:09:43.510 --> 00:09:45.500
loyal to Her.

00:09:45.500 --> 00:09:49.620
During one of their recovered broadcasts,
the pair of Fifthist hosts were even able

00:09:49.620 --> 00:09:52.380
to prank call the SCP Foundation itself.

00:09:52.380 --> 00:09:58.450
A Junior Researcher Jones was contacted by
the two men and ridiculed for his association

00:09:58.450 --> 00:10:00.430
with the SCP Foundation.

00:10:00.430 --> 00:10:04.760
But after a few jokes at Junior Researcher
Jones’s expense, Steros and Winters began

00:10:04.760 --> 00:10:09.140
to insidiously implant ideas of Fifthism in
the researcher’s head.

00:10:09.140 --> 00:10:13.940
They referred to this as giving Jones ‘the
Truth’, something they both intended to

00:10:13.940 --> 00:10:17.240
do for all their listeners in order to save
them.

00:10:17.240 --> 00:10:22.079
When asked what they meant, Winters and Steros
made vague allusions to the Truth being an

00:10:22.079 --> 00:10:25.550
infinite knowledge that only She could bestow.

00:10:25.550 --> 00:10:28.370
Jones had no idea who She was meant to be.

00:10:28.370 --> 00:10:29.980
“Our guiding light?

00:10:29.980 --> 00:10:30.980
Our creator?”

00:10:30.980 --> 00:10:34.630
Salem described, before adding, “The very
thoughts that should be infiltrating your

00:10:34.630 --> 00:10:35.829
head right now?”

00:10:35.829 --> 00:10:40.450
It seemed that, through this call, the two
hosts had managed to successfully imbed their

00:10:40.450 --> 00:10:44.430
Fifthist concepts into the mind of Junior
Researcher Jones.

00:10:44.430 --> 00:10:46.639
And they weren’t about to stop there.

00:10:46.639 --> 00:10:51.500
During another call on their show, both hosts
spoke with a Wallington, New Jersey resident

00:10:51.500 --> 00:10:56.070
named Wendy Ricefield, who was already a self-proclaimed
Fifthist.

00:10:56.070 --> 00:11:00.760
Steros and Winters talked Wendy through a
ritual to learn the Truth, involving her drawing

00:11:00.760 --> 00:11:04.600
sigils on the walls and floor of her home,
and lighting candles.

00:11:04.600 --> 00:11:08.920
The phone line picked up wet squelching noises
coming from the other side, the splintering

00:11:08.920 --> 00:11:13.709
of wood, and Wendy screaming for help as she
tried to run from her home…

00:11:13.709 --> 00:11:16.430
only for something to drag her back inside.

00:11:16.430 --> 00:11:21.170
Eventually, the Foundation made the executive
decision to step in and deal with the situation

00:11:21.170 --> 00:11:23.110
in New Jersey directly.

00:11:23.110 --> 00:11:27.370
Steros and Winters’ operation was getting
out of hand, more and more people in the surrounding

00:11:27.370 --> 00:11:32.190
area were being brainwashed into believing
in Fifthist concepts, and compelled to complete

00:11:32.190 --> 00:11:33.850
bizarre rituals.

00:11:33.850 --> 00:11:38.350
Sending a team in to apprehend the cult leaders,
Foundation personnel discovered Salem Steros

00:11:38.350 --> 00:11:41.180
and numerous other members of the Commune.

00:11:41.180 --> 00:11:47.589
They had gathered at an instance of SCP-5967
that had manifested in Wallington… the same

00:11:47.589 --> 00:11:50.570
place that Wendy Ricefield had been from.

00:11:50.570 --> 00:11:55.399
Steros and his Fifthist followers were discovered
holding hands and standing in a circle around

00:11:55.399 --> 00:12:02.310
the anomalous pillar of eyeballs, as well
as approaching it and… licking SCP-5967.

00:12:02.310 --> 00:12:07.650
The members of the Commune were rounded up,
and most were sent to be kept in isolation

00:12:07.650 --> 00:12:08.650
at Site-9.

00:12:08.650 --> 00:12:12.970
However, Salem Steros was brought to Site-83
for questioning.

00:12:12.970 --> 00:12:17.990
Junior Researcher Umar Hadid conducted an
interview as to the exact nature of the goddess

00:12:17.990 --> 00:12:23.110
Her that Steros and Winters often referred
to, and the anomalous rituals the pair had

00:12:23.110 --> 00:12:24.680
been involved with.

00:12:24.680 --> 00:12:29.630
Salem was less than co-operative, He demanded
to be set free in the interest of saving people

00:12:29.630 --> 00:12:31.930
by spreading the Truth with Caesar.

00:12:31.930 --> 00:12:36.940
However, he did reveal some key information
about Her.

00:12:36.940 --> 00:12:42.160
According to Steros’ claims, She was a goddess
actively meddling with reality and influencing

00:12:42.160 --> 00:12:43.209
human actions.

00:12:43.209 --> 00:12:48.000
He told Hadid that if he killed the Junior
Researcher right there, it would be because

00:12:48.000 --> 00:12:49.510
She willed it.

00:12:49.510 --> 00:12:54.940
Sometime before, both Salem and his cult co-leader
Caesar had been stargazing in the meadowlands,

00:12:54.940 --> 00:12:57.410
a remote field in East Rutherford.

00:12:57.410 --> 00:13:02.820
That’s when they had allegedly heard Her
voice, and been told the Truth.

00:13:02.820 --> 00:13:07.730
This reality-warping goddess was intending
to return home, but that way back was broken.

00:13:07.730 --> 00:13:11.390
So, according to Steros, she needed their
help.

00:13:11.390 --> 00:13:17.790
This was the reason he and Winters began creating
instances of SCP-5967 - the eyeball pillars

00:13:17.790 --> 00:13:23.449
apparently acted as beacons, like a GPS signal
allowing Her to come back.

00:13:23.449 --> 00:13:27.959
The pair and the rest of the Commune were
attempting to prove their loyalty to Her,

00:13:27.959 --> 00:13:32.470
in the hopes that they would potentially be
allowed to transcend reality, in accordance

00:13:32.470 --> 00:13:34.490
with the Fifthist principle.

00:13:34.490 --> 00:13:40.360
Salem Steros was remanded into SCP Foundation
custody, and kept detained in a containment

00:13:40.360 --> 00:13:43.290
suite surrounded by three Scranton Reality
Anchors.

00:13:43.290 --> 00:13:48.730
Shortly after, the members of MTF Lambda-5
were dispatched, heading to the location Steros

00:13:48.730 --> 00:13:52.100
had inadvertently revealed during his interrogation.

00:13:52.100 --> 00:13:57.029
Their mission was to arrest Caesar Winters…
who remained at large after the leader of

00:13:57.029 --> 00:13:59.029
Lambda-5 was compromised.

00:13:59.029 --> 00:14:03.800
Eventually, Gamma was able to contact the
Foundation, who sent a containment team as

00:14:03.800 --> 00:14:04.800
backup.

00:14:04.800 --> 00:14:09.190
They secured the surviving MTF operative,
along with the infected team leader Alpha

00:14:09.190 --> 00:14:13.029
and the instance of SCP-5967 on the scene.

00:14:13.029 --> 00:14:17.700
Gamma was offered medical treatment and presented
with a Silver Lion badge for her efforts in

00:14:17.700 --> 00:14:21.829
the field, along with a two-week vacation
as a reward.

00:14:21.829 --> 00:14:25.820
That did little to stop the nightmares, though;
she wasn’t the same.

00:14:25.820 --> 00:14:27.590
And neither was Alpha.

00:14:27.590 --> 00:14:33.100
After two long weeks of psychological screening,
and no further hostile or anomalous activity,

00:14:33.100 --> 00:14:36.110
Alpha was interviewed by Junior Researcher
Hadid.

00:14:36.110 --> 00:14:40.760
During their discussion, Alpha - real name
Cassandra ‘Sandy’ Dankofski - described

00:14:40.760 --> 00:14:47.220
that she could still hear a voice in her head,
rambling about the Truth, Fifthism, and eyeballs.

00:14:47.220 --> 00:14:48.960
Amnestic treatment wasn’t helping.

00:14:48.960 --> 00:14:52.890
Suddenly, someone within the Foundation played
a clip of Casear Winters’ voice over the

00:14:52.890 --> 00:14:57.690
facility speakers, taken from one of his and
Steros’ radio broadcasts.

00:14:57.690 --> 00:15:02.190
It triggered an instant paranoid reaction
from Sandy, followed by her opening her mouth

00:15:02.190 --> 00:15:06.329
and revealing something growing inside - Another
eyeball.

00:15:06.329 --> 00:15:10.949
Some kind of post-hypnotic suggestion, or
other form of brainwashing had affected her,

00:15:10.949 --> 00:15:13.070
and she began exhibiting anomalous behavior.

00:15:13.070 --> 00:15:16.000
“Tell me, Hadid, are you a Fifthist now?”

00:15:16.000 --> 00:15:17.120
she asked the Junior Researcher.

00:15:17.120 --> 00:15:19.660
“Are you ready to see the Truth?”

00:15:19.660 --> 00:15:22.800
Hadid rushed out of the room, shutting the
door behind him.

00:15:22.800 --> 00:15:27.389
Pacing around the room, Sandy started drawing
strange sigils of unknown origin on the floor

00:15:27.389 --> 00:15:30.600
and walls, lighting a candle through anomalous
means.

00:15:30.600 --> 00:15:35.730
There then came a bright flash of light, as
a four-legged entity appeared and attacked

00:15:35.730 --> 00:15:36.730
Alpha.

00:15:36.730 --> 00:15:40.710
The two merged, causing her body to change
until it was unrecognizable.

00:15:40.710 --> 00:15:43.800
Well, as human, anyway.

00:15:43.800 --> 00:15:48.290
Standing in the interrogation room where Sandy
had been standing, was a contorted mass of

00:15:48.290 --> 00:15:51.970
flesh and muscle, with multiple eyeballs staring
out from it.

00:15:51.970 --> 00:15:55.440
She had turned into another instance of SCP-5967.

00:15:55.440 --> 00:15:57.649
They all had.

00:15:57.649 --> 00:15:58.910
They were people.

00:15:58.910 --> 00:16:02.639
Steros and Winters had made beacons out of
living people…

00:16:02.639 --> 00:16:09.061
Now check out “SCP-3760 - LIKE A DOLL'S
EYES” and “THE EYE PODS - SCP-131” for

00:16:09.061 --> 00:16:09.561
more!

